%% Invite someone to a family and let them join. Claude rewrites this via /update-diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Family Owner
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (FamilyService)
  participant D as SQLite
  actor I as Invited person

  O->>W: Invite link, pick a role
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/families/invites
  Note over A: only an Owner may create invites
  A->>D: store the invite with the hash of its token, expires in 48 hours
  A-->>W: the token, shown once
  O->>I: shares the link yourself, for example in a message
  I->>W: open /accept-invite with the token
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/families/invites/accept (anonymous, rate limited)
  A->>D: find the invite by the hash of the token
  alt expired, revoked or already used
    A-->>W: 409 Conflict
  else valid
    A->>D: create the account with the default User app role
    A->>D: add the family member with the invited role
    A->>D: mark the invite as used
    A-->>W: 204 No Content
    Note over I,W: the person signs in through the normal login
  end
